## UI Library Policy (Shadcn-only)

- Allowed UI primitives: `@radix-ui/*` and components built under `components/ui/` (shadcn).
- Disallowed UI libraries: MUI, AntD, Chakra UI, Bootstrap, Mantine, RSuite, Evergreen, Grommet, Blueprint, Carbon, NextUI, PrimeReact, Semantic UI, Tremor.
- Charts: prefer first-party components under `components/ui/` or custom SVG. Do not introduce third-party charting libraries without explicit approval.

## Implementation Notes

- Create new UI elements as shadcn components under `components/ui/`.
- Centralize theme tokens and colors to match Algérie Telecom (Bleu/Vert).
- Keep files ≤ 200 lines; extract subcomponents where needed.
